WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Welcome to the show about the sea.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Today we talk about tides.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:50.000
A short message from the audio sponsor.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:10.000
The moon pulls the water.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Spring tides come with the full moon.
